gwriter, record producer, and founder of the record label Groovl1n, The L1VE, and Studio GL1DE. He is a former member of the South Korean boy group VIXX and its sub-unit VIXX LR. He debuted as a solo artist on January 9, 2017, with the release of his debut mini album R.eal1ze.","title":"Ravi (rapper)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ravi_%28rapper%29"}}}}